    "title": "Prince George's County Council passes 2-year moratorium on new data centers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Darcy Spencer ,\n1 days ago Sitting first as the committee of the whole, the Prince George's County Council passed a two-year moratorium on new data center development in the county. It's one of the toughest pauses on data centers in the region, but it didn't come without spirited debate on both sides of the issue and an attempt to scale it back. Read full article",
